{
 "total": 30.358,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 3.679,
   "texto": "Jason picks Lucia up from prison, and says one line that changes everything.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 3.739,
   "b": 6.209,
   "texto": "Part two of five. Follow so you don't miss part three.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 6.269,
   "b": 8.9,
   "texto": "Clue one. He tells the guard he might have been there before.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 8.96,
   "b": 10.672,
   "texto": "Why would a free man know a prison that well?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 10.732,
   "b": 14.121,
   "texto": "Clue two. The trailer keeps cutting to police bodycams and dashcams.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 14.181,
   "b": 16.26,
   "texto": "That point of view is rare in a GTA trailer.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 16.32,
   "b": 18.678,
   "texto": "So the theory says Jason is working undercover.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 18.738,
   "b": 20.9,
   "texto": "And some fans think he's the one who betrays Lucia.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 20.96,
   "b": 23.837,
   "texto": "But if that's true, the story might not decide the ending alone.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 23.897,
   "b": 27.536,
   "texto": "The 2022 leak showed a hidden system that might decide who betrays who.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 27.596,
   "b": 30.358,
   "texto": "Cop or criminal? Comment now. Part three is next.",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
